    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage an interstellar spy business in a strategy game with lunchbreak runs. Explore a randomly generated universe, expand your espionage network, exploit weaknesses in corporate information security, and exterminate companies by strategic sale of their information to the competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/436bcbf23fc32d5519515b69d6a50551.poster.avif?t=1755668434\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/436bcbf23fc32d5519515b69d6a50551.webm?t=1755668434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/436bcbf23fc32d5519515b69d6a50551.mp4?t=1755668434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a randomly generated universe with your trusted probe. Find planets, asteroids and space stations. Expand your empire by building relays, operations hubs and admin centers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/f4171e19924c84df7941aa1979796c23.poster.avif?t=1755668434\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/f4171e19924c84df7941aa1979796c23.webm?t=1755668434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/f4171e19924c84df7941aa1979796c23.mp4?t=1755668434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch operations from your hubs, target planets and their corporations to steal their data. Target corporations with multiple agents to maximize your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/7a2be37e2dac6aa5aff29d8ee22ec262.poster.avif?t=1755668434\" width=780 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/7a2be37e2dac6aa5aff29d8ee22ec262.webm?t=1755668434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/7a2be37e2dac6aa5aff29d8ee22ec262.mp4?t=1755668434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell the stolen data to the highest bidder - or keep the data to yourself to keep a corporation from gaining too much influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/42a24db59dd980d56e6b6c6ea1b4a511.avif?t=1755668434\" width=1035 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your data go to good use as you change the corporate landscape by strategic sale of information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/13df498dfcf0fc7bbb3e45e84500d98f.poster.avif?t=1755668434\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/13df498dfcf0fc7bbb3e45e84500d98f.webm?t=1755668434\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/13df498dfcf0fc7bbb3e45e84500d98f.mp4?t=1755668434\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and steal technology, develop it and put the technology to good use - spying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make enough money to earn your retirement on a private planet - or end up failing and bumming it on a cheap asteroid with your space dog.</p>",
